  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「たんったか、たかたか♪　たんたんた〜ん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「ここ掘れ、ワンワン♪　ワン、ツ〜、スリ〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「枯れ木に花を〜、咲かせましょ〜♪　正直じいさん、知らずに食べた〜……ふんふふん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_still_image"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「よぉし！　屋上の庭園、朝の水やり完了です〜☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「えへん。どの植物もすくすく育ってますね〜、きれいな花もいっぱい咲きました♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「みどり部長も褒めてくれるでしょ〜、近ごろ園芸部の活動をいろいろ任せてくれて嬉しいです！　」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「この調子で、いっぱいいっぱい役に立ってみせますＹＯ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「この屋上の庭園は、わたしが初めて任されたわたしだけで維持・管理する箱庭！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「いわば、『くるみの楽園』……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「最高の食材を実らせちゃいますよ〜、ふんふふん♪　枯れたりせずに、順調に育っちゃってくださ〜い☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「ふふふ。昨年度、みどり部長が土壌を安定させてくれてたとはいえ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「屋上の庭園の維持と管理、わたしバッチリできちゃってますよね！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「どのお花も、すっごく元気です〜！　美味しくな〜れ、萌え萌えきゅん☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「わたしも成長したってことですね、えへんえへん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「もっと張りきっちゃいますよ〜、みどり部長に『い〜こい〜こ』してもらうために！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「もっともぉ〜っと、咲き誇っちゃってくださ〜い♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（……おっとっと。お水とか、栄養剤をあげすぎちゃいけないんですよね。逆に枯れちゃうんですよね、うんうん）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（あとは可哀想ですけど、雑草を抜き抜きしちゃいます〜♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（ど、どれが雑草でしたっけ……。これはお花の芽ですよね、引っこ抜いちゃ駄目です。ん〜っと、ん〜っと？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（むう〜？　わたしも、まだまだ修行が足りませんね。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（みどり部長に写メって確認してもらいましょうか、『これ抜いていいやつですか』……っと♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（わわっ、もうこんな時間なんですね。スマホの画面見て初めて気づきましたっ、いっけない！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（今日は『新入生懇親会』だから、ふつうの授業がないとはいえ〜？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（遅刻しちゃあ、まずいですよね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（みどり部長、緑化委員長になったから『懇親会』で新入生の世話を焼くって言ってましたし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（わたしも、『補佐役』としてお手伝いしてますし？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（そっちのお仕事も、しなきゃいけません。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（あぁ大忙しですね〜、猫の手も借りたいです。にゃんこ、花壇とか荒らすから園芸部の天敵なんですけど〜♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（……猫って、食べられるんでしょうか？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（えへへ、何だかお腹がすいちゃいましたね〜。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（そういえば水やりするために早起きして学校にきたから、朝ご飯まだ食べてなかったような？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（お弁当、つくってきましたし。見晴らしがいいし、ここで食べちゃいましょうかね。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（まだちょっと、時間もあるはずですし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "（いやでも、先に教室に移動しといたほうがいいかも……う〜ん？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 19,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 478
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "くるみ",
    "text": "「……おやぁ？」"
